Z||000000||2xsess||02-23-2001||11:35 PM||||I don't have this one anymore but, I just got a scanner and had to share these pics.<P>Here's what it looked like when we rolled it into the garage. And this was the way it sat on the trailer all the way from Kill Hill in CT to northeast PA.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88GT_t-top(10)s.JPG"> <BR>This is a few weeks later after I had started removing body panels.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88GT-86GT(2).JPG"> <BR>This is the only picture I have of it once it was done   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> and this was actually a picture I took of my motorcycle right after I got it.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Katanaand88GT.JPG"> <P>This is the one that got away from me, i miss this car so badly, it was a 5spd, loaded except leather. ~~sniff~~sniff~~~<P>There's about 20 pictures of it in my album. <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1463738&a=11750743" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1463738&a=11750743</A> <P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">       <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A><p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 02-23-2001).]||||reg||1
