Z||000004||2xsess||02-24-2001||06:37 PM||||No, I didn't, they only gave me $1500 as a trade, I paid more for it than that as it was, then all the work and added extras...~sigh~<P>Well, live and learn, I no longer listen to her when she says anything about cars, except, "Honey the van is making a clunking noise" or things along those lines.<P>No offense to any of our female memebers but my wife won't even try to learn how to check the oil.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">      <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||8
